  hintId: tutorial_syntax
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Syntax
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Syntax</b>


    Syntax is the set of rules used to write instructions
    for processing data and controlling robotic systems.


    Every command must
    follow the correct structure in order to be understood and executed properly
    by the robot.


    Using syntax correctly allows you to:


    Control robot
    movement

    Collect and manage resources

    Process information from the
    environment

    Make decisions using logic and conditions

    Automate complex
    behaviors


    Even small syntax mistakes may cause commands to fail or produce
    unexpected results.


    Understanding syntax is an important step in learning
    programming, as it teaches how instructions are structured and interpreted by
    a system.'
  isImageBig: 0
